issa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4LwvU9SZc8QQzW1X1FAPhNbXnEU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1226863,\"title\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having thwarted Bowser's previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir's crusade.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1185806,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cxXSF4aY5N2cOGwaga5OnpPFHzk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dY4LyVSvjk9dN20YsxuouaMIMox.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Paw Patrol lands on a mysterious dinosaur island after a storm, where they meet Rex, a stranded pup. When Humdinger's reckless mining triggers a volcano, the team faces their biggest rescue mission yet to save the island.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":808,\"title\":\"Shrek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zscUsmzDJFZjUY8f8BQqMSWlmNQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Biv1mSzaaxWOqvcnDZn4GcYEAb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It ain't easy bein' green -- especially if you're a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":315162,\"title\":\"Puss in Boots: The Last Wish\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kuf6dutpsT0vSVehic3EZIqkOBt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jr8tSoJGj33XLgFBy6lmZhpGQNu.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Puss in Boots discovers that his passion for adventure has taken its toll: He has burned through eight of his nine lives, leaving him with only one life left. Puss sets out on an epic journey to find the mythical Last Wish and restore his nine lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1241982,\"title\":\"Moana 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aLVkiINlIeCkcZIzb7XHzPYgO6L.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vYqt6kb4lcF8wwqsMMaULkP9OEn.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After receiving an unexpected call from her wayfinding ancestors, Moana journeys alongside Maui and a new crew to the far seas of Oceania and into dangerous, long-lost waters for an adventure unlike anything she's ever faced.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":330457,\"title\":\"Frozen II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mINJaa34MtknCYl5AjtNJzWj8cD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AoSZyb37ljMAxw0RdeQEBHKtgcc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Elsa, Anna, Kristoff and Olaf head far into the forest to learn the truth about an ancient mystery of their kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11688,\"title\":\"The Emperor's New Groove\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wwbgkXQBEKtnyIJapk6gUgWkVw8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mZj8EUr6F1x2PWZjKPxaeYd5WRw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the self‑absorbed Emperor Kuzco is accidentally transformed into a llama, he must rely on a humble villager to survive the jungle and reclaim his throne.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10192,\"title\":\"Shrek Forever After\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6HrfPZtKcGmX2tUWW3cnciZTaSD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uzzTystB8lL0mRDII5Sfs5HxgkI.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A midlife-crisis burdened Shrek, longing for the days of when he felt like a real ogre, makes a pact with magic deal-maker Rumpelstiltskin. But when he's duped and sent to a twisted version of Far Far Away—where Rumpelstiltskin is king, ogres are hunted, and he and Fiona have never met—he sets out to restore his world and reclaim his true love.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":810,\"title\":\"Shrek the Third\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n4SexGGQzI26E269tfpa80MZaGV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wvXxKpFGXvQJRB0nvvfURhRD3C0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the King of Far Far Away dies, Shrek and Fiona are to succede. However, Shrek wants to return to his cozy swamp and live in peace and quiet, so when he finds out there is another heir to the throne, he and Donkey set off to bring him back to rule the kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4523,\"title\":\"Enchanted\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4UpRDi0w84aNrigr9p049rMHiy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn't operate on a \\\"happily ever after\\\" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"tNV4i3BqUGY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Y0RW8EW08Dk\",\"name\":\"Official Teaser Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}